#direction: right
#spacing: 10
#gravity: .8
#arrowSize: 4
#font: 'Open Sans'
#background: transparent
#fill: #f4f6fb
#title: di-resolve

[ServiceProvider|
The default IServiceProvider.]

[IKeyedServiceProvider|
Retrieves services
using a key and a type.]

[IAsyncDisposable|
Provides a mechanism for 
releasing unmanaged resources
asynchronously.]

[IDisposable|
Provides a mechanism for 
releasing unmanaged resources.]

[IServiceProvider|
Defines a mechanism for 
retrieving a service object 
that is, an object that provides
custom support to other objects.]

[IServiceProvider] <:-- [IKeyedServiceProvider]
[IKeyedServiceProvider] <:-- [ServiceProvider]
[IAsyncDisposable] <:-- [ServiceProvider]
[IDisposable] <:-- [ServiceProvider]